target        : h1x
payload       : brief-literal H1: stock page 0 verbatim but the park at 0x92000 instead of the real landing
code0         : +0x2480000 (park sits at 0x92000)
expected      : refused, or a udf/die, never a park
proves        : the imm26 field is words, not bytes: stock branches to +0x2480000
if refused    : nothing changes; it is the arithmetic control for H1
os_version    : 0x1c000185 (stock)
partition     : 100663296 B
flash         : boot_b, restore_image backup/64f70df8/boot_b.img between runs
measure       : tooling/50-boot-timing.sh, plateau vs the stock control
